<div class="about mx-auto px-4 py-3 max-w-xl">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">ankiweb {{ version }}</h2>
  <p class="mb-3">
    <strong>Unofficial, personal, single-user project.</strong> An independent
    browser port of Anki — not affiliated with or endorsed by Ankitects, and not
    the official AnkiWeb sync service.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-4">
    ankiweb is free software, licensed under the <strong>GNU Affero General
      Public License, version 3 or later</strong> (AGPL-3.0-or-later). It is
    distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY.
  </p>
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Source code (AGPL §13)</h3>
  <p class="mb-3">
    Because ankiweb is a network service, you are entitled to the complete
    Corresponding Source of this running version, at no charge.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-3">
    <strong>This deployment's source:</strong> {% if source_url %}<a
        class="link link-primary"
        href="{{ source_url }}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >{{ source_url }}</a>{% else %}<em>not configured — set the <code
        >ANKIWEB_SOURCE_URL</code> environment variable to the location of this
        deployment's source.</em>{% endif %}
  </p>
  <p class="mb-2"><strong>Upstream sources it derives from and bundles:</strong></p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
    <li>
      Anki / aqt 26.9.2 — AGPL-3.0-or-later — <a
        class="link link-primary"
        href="{{ anki_src }}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >{{ anki_src }}</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      AnkiConnect — GPL-3.0-or-later — <a
        class="link link-primary"
        href="{{ ac_src }}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >{{ ac_src }}</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Full attribution is in the project's <code>LICENSE</code> and <code
    >THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md</code>.
  </p>
  <p><a class="link link-primary" href="/deckbrowser">← {{ tr.actions_decks() | tr_clean }}</a></p>
</div>
